  <h1>AI Commerce Studio</h1>
  <p>Private E-Commerce Research Platform</p>

  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>AI Commerce Studio is a personal research application
  under development for evaluating e-commerce opportunities,
  including physical resale and print-on-demand products.</p>

  <h2>Features</h2>
  <p>The platform is designed to compare public marketplace
  listing information, product pricing, competition,
  estimated costs, and potential profitability.</p>

  <h2>Etsy API Usage</h2>
  <p>The proposed Etsy integration is for read-only research
  of publicly available listing and shop information.
  It will not create or modify listings, place orders,
  or send messages.</p>

  <p><small>Independent research project.
  Not affiliated with or endorsed by Etsy.</small></p>
